\n- 4.8 dev\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (e60029208) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Intel(R) Arc(TM) A750 Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.6790) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12400F (12 threads) - 31.81 GiB memory - WASAPI (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI started noticing errors in my console after enabling attribute compression.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a mesh with compressed attributes.\n- Open the scene containing it.\n- You will see an error similar to `ERROR: scene\\resources\\mesh.cpp:347 - Condition \"vertices.is_empty()\" is true. Returning: Ref<TriangleMesh>()`, but the mesh still loads.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis is a basic scene with a mesh with compressed vertices inside it.\n\n```\n[gd_scene format=4 uid=\"uid://onm4auivthbm\"]\n\n[sub_resource type=\"StandardMaterial3D\" id=\"StandardMaterial3D_w0x6o\"]\n\n[sub_resource type=\"ArrayMesh\" id=\"ArrayMesh_qrnp5\"]\nresource_name = \"Low_0_0_0\"\n_surfaces = [{\n\"aabb\": AABB(-1.0001669, -0.049603514, 4.0209312, 1.0756459, 0.10078357, 2.0280595),\n\"attribute_data\": PackedByteArray(\"Qk06AP/4SwD//4MA//+DAP/uSwBCTToA//pLAP//gwD//4MA/+5LAEJNOgD/+ksA//+DAP//gwD/7ksAQk06AP/6SwD//4MA//+DAP/uSwBCTToA//ZLAP//gwD//4MA//BLAEJNOgD/+EsA//+DAP//gwD/7ksA\"),\n\"format\": 34896614345,\n\"index_count\": 12,\n\"index_data\": PackedByteArray(\"AAABAAIAAwAAAAIABAAAAAMABQAEAAMA\"),\n\"material\": SubResource(\"StandardMaterial3D_w0x6o\"),\n\"primitive\": 3,\n\"uv_scale\": Vector4(0, 0, 0, 0),\n\"vertex_count\": 6,\n\"vertex_data\": PackedByteArray(\"AAASfpR7AACeCuekAAAAAFHvAACHBgAAruw6LySBAAB/CRD7CPsAAP///////wAA\")\n}]\n\n[node name=\"Chunk_0_0_0_Low\" type=\"Node\" unique_id=1819802962]\n\n[node name=\"MeshInstance3D\" type=\"MeshInstance3D\" parent=\".\" unique_id=1249894766]\nlayers = 33\nmesh = SubResource(\"ArrayMesh_qrnp5\")\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"M